flowchart TB
  P["power/reset 与当前 Generation 有效"] --> O["OS/VM 与 IPC 承载可用"]
  O --> S["FDBUS 进程启动"]
  S --> L["listener/transport ready"]
  L --> R["registry/endpoint 注册完成"]
  R --> D["依赖数据与初始快照可用"]
  D --> F["FDBUS business READY"]
  F --> H["HMI 获取 READY，连接/订阅"]
  H --> C["当前代首个有效样本被消费"]
  C --> U["Cluster/HMI Ready"]
